- Admin: 307 → redirect (same, correct)

Let me verify the content of landing renders the hero, and follow the customer redirect chain to confirm it goes to the landing sign-in (https://capitech.me/sign-in — which won't resolve until DNS). The redirect target for customer/admin: NEXT_PUBLIC_LANDING_URL=https://capitech.me — DNS not set → dead end until domains configured. That's expected pre-DNS.

Now attach the domains:
1. POST /v9/projects/capitech-landing/domains {"name":"capitech.me"}
2. POST /v9/projects/capitech-customer/domains {"name":"app.capitech.me"}
3. POST /v9/projects/capitech-admin/domains {"name":"admin.capitech.me"}

Then GET each domain to see verification status + DNS instructions. capitech.me apex needs A records (or CNAME flattening); subdomains need CNAME to cname.vercel-dns.com.

